# Pandas Practice Programs - CIE 1

## Overview
This repo contains 13 Python programs that practice core Pandas operations.

## Files
- `CIE1_variant.ipynb` 
- `README.md` - this file

## Topics Covered
1. Creating a DataFrame with random integers and adding a computed column
2. Row-wise and column-wise sums
3. Handling missing values (NaN) with mean imputation
4. Dropping rows that contain NaN values
5. Aggregation with groupby (sum and mean)
6. Total sales per category using groupby
7. Merging two DataFrames on a common column
8. MultiIndex DataFrame: indexing and slicing
9. MultiIndex with Category and SubCategory: group sums
10. Applying a function to a DataFrame
11. Creating a new column with a lambda function
12. Text data: converting strings to uppercase
13. Text data: extracting the first three characters

## Libraries Used
pandas, numpy
